	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Rediit hodie <persName ref="p1227">Froschouerus</persName> ac literas mihi plurimas attulit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3046">Victorinus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Strigelius</persName>, professor theologiae <placeName ref="l284">Lipsiae</placeName>, amicissimas ad me scribit literas ac Confessionem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nostram valde praedicat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Idem faciunt <placeName ref="l830">Angli</placeName> et passim viri doctissimi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Pestis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>per <placeName ref="l749">Saxoniam</placeName> et vicinas gentes saevit satis crudeliter.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Elector Saxo compa<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ravit sibi equitum 3000 ac totus est in armis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p20484">Ioannes Fridericus</persName> iunior <placeName ref="l537">Vinariensis</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p20484">Johann Friedrich II. der Mittlere</persName>, zu <placeName ref="l537">Weimar</placeName>(?).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>reclamante fratre<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Herzog <persName ref="p20553">Johann Wilhelm</persName>.</note> eius fovet <persName>Grundpachium</persName>, cui et Gottham tradidit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Hunc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>una cum <persName>Grunpachio</persName> oppressum cupit Saxo, ac periculum est, ne ingens oboriatu<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>r bellum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Comitia <placeName ref="l142">Erdfordiensia</placeName> progressum habuere nullum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Habuit ibi <persName>Palatinus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>elector suos legatos, ne causae suae videretur diffidere; habuerunt et alii principes <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>suos legatos ibi; verum Saxo elector et <persName ref="p3590">lantgravius Hassiae</persName> nolunt <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>audire de ullis comitiis, in quibus alii condemnentur et in quibus evangelici <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>odiosius committantur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Also ist gar nüt darus worden, und als ich ver<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>stan, wirt nitt bald ützid darus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Princeps <persName>elector Palatinus</persName> suos omnes in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>armis esse iubet et promptissimum habet populum, nobilitatem imprimis spontan<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>eam<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Videt princeps prudentissimus passim infelicia bellorum spargi semina, sibi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ergo suisque et piis omnibus in tempore vult consulere.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l640">Flandria</placeName>, <placeName ref="l20">Hollandia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l2529">Brabantia</placeName> et totum pene <placeName ref="l808">Belgicum</placeName> recepit evangelium.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName>Hagae</placeName>, <placeName ref="l13">Ansderdami</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l2457">Roterodami</placeName>, Traiecti, quod <placeName ref="l518">Utricht</placeName> nuncupant, et in aliis urbibus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>celebribus eiectis aris missalibus omnibus pariter omnia confregerunt <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ac deleverunt simulachra.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Mira ea de re et scribuntur et dicuntur ab iis, qui <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ipsi testes oculati astiterunt et viderunt mirabilia domini; vere enim mi<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ra<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>bilis est dominus et operatur incredibilia et inexpectata.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ext<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>at Germanice <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>scriptus et impressus libellus de eo, quomodo <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l15">Antverpiae</placeName> per omnia templa cum aris sublata sint idola.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Saepe iam recordor <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>beatae memoriae senioris <persName ref="p1227">Froschoueri</persName>, qui saepe ab annis 20 mihi dixit:</foreign> "Ich <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>verkouff diner und der <placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName> buͤcher nienan hin meer dann in das <placeName ref="l20">Nider<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>land</placeName> und ich acht, du werdists noch erläben, das grosse enderungen da be<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>schächen werdent und dise leer nitt one frucht wirt erbgan.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Laudetur dominus et <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>augeat suam gratiam magis et magis; alioqui enim magna ubique se aperiunt <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>pericula, ut orandus sit dominus sedulo, ne multo sanguine fuso per gravem per<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>sequtionem pii exerceantur.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p7705">Granvella</persName> enim et <placeName>Hispanici</placeName> non quiescunt; insaniunt <placeName ref="l1322">Lovanienses</placeName> et episcopi cum monac<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>his et unctis.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Principes et tota nobilitas Inferioris Germaniae coniunxerunt se arctissime cum evangelicis etc.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><placeName>Orangien</placeName>, <placeName>Nassow</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2126">Büren</placeName> und <placeName>Egmund</placeName>, <placeName>Brederod</placeName>, <placeName>Berg</placeName> etc.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l267">Coloniae</placeName> quoque <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>in urbe sibi mire metuunt rasi.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Nuper [cum] quidam innocens ad lanienam raperetur, tota tribus vietro<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>rum erupit et manu armata iam cedendum eripuit; praeses suppliciorum et <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>carnifex vix vivi evaserunt.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Clamat populus satis et nimium satis esse saevi<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>tum hactenus, se nolle amplius pati, quae passus sit.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Ergo ad portas et per urbem <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>custodiae sunt dispositae.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Man will nitt reformieren mitt lieb und vernunfft, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>man will immerdar un<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>schuldig lüth töden; so muͦ<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>ß es wol also zuͦgan.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>In regno <placeName ref="l830">Angliae</placeName> omnia sunt pacata; exercentur tantum adhuc dissidia illa <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>exorta ex re vestiaria.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l2665">Hibernis</placeName>, quam vocant <placeName ref="l2665">Irlandriam</placeName>, exortus <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>est contra <persName ref="p18554">reginam Angliae</persName> tumultus; ideo exercitum instructum misit regina <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>contra barbaros; conflixere et vicit regina; recolligunt tamen illi se ex fuga <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et novis subsidiis sese instruunt, unde et regina suum illum exercitum novis <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>instruit copiis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><persName ref="p18212">Regina Scotiae</persName> peperit filium maximo cum totius regni gaudio; vocantur <persName ref="p20341">rex <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Galliae</persName>, <persName ref="p18554">regina Angliae</persName> et ducissa <placeName>Sabaudiae</placeName>, qui regem ex fonte sacro suscipia<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nt <placeName ref="l130">Edinburgi</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Tranquillae sunt in <placeName ref="l2524">Scotia</placeName> ecclesiae et pure praedicatur <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>evangelium.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Pax confecta est inter reginam, principes et nobilitatem, deo <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>gratia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/><placeName ref="l260">Cracovia</placeName> calendis augusti ad me scribitur: <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniae</placeName> regnum illud nostrum satis <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ingenti versatur in periculo; nam <persName>Moschus</persName> instructissimo cum exercitu dicitur in<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>vasurus Lithuaniam.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Tartari superioribus diebus in finibus <placeName>Podoliae</placeName> multa <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>populando vastandoque loca damnum nobis irreparabile dederunt.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Metuunt sibi <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>vehementer universi propter <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName>, qui ipse innumerabili cum exercitu movet <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>in <placeName ref="l882">Hungariam</placeName>; licet enim rex noster foedere coniunctus sit cum <placeName ref="l2510">Turcarum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>imperatore, vix tamen nostri evadent incursiones irruptionesque hincinde vagantium <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>militum <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicorum</placeName>, qui longe et late occupant omnia.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Misit rex <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>noster amplissimam legationem in <placeName ref="l2562">Prussiam</placeName>; nam et <placeName ref="l2562">Prussia</placeName> dicitur se nonnihil se<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>iungere a nostro principe.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Ariani et anabaptistae nuper ex universo regno <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>sunt proscripti.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Misera est rerum facies.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Dominus nostri misereatur.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z23"/>Octobris 1. 1566.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la">Contraxi hoc veluti compendium ex pluribus <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>lit<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>eris ad me datis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Tu lectum re<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>mitte.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="signature">[Ohne Unterschrift.]</note>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[von anderer Hand, nur einige Zusätze u. Schluss: "Contraxi" etc. von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> selbst]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
